  "body": "Enjoy the best of Kohimarama living in this beautifully maintained, stand-alone Terry Hitchcock-designed home. \r\n\r\nJust a hop, skip and a jump from Kohi Beach and its vibrant cafes, this private, secure sanctuary offers three bedrooms, three bathrooms and effortless lock-up-and-leave convenience.\r\n\r\nSwedish oak floors, an award-winning kitchen and quality fittings elevate the interiors, while a maintenance-free garden, double carport and excellent storage make life easy.\r\n\r\nAn appealing alternative to apartment living, ideal for professionals, executive couples, retirees or anyone seeking a premium coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWith sought-after schools within walking distance, this is Kohi living made easy!\r\n\r\nPrivate. Stylish. Perfectly positioned. Come and discover it!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the freedom, privacy and convenience of a premium Kohi lifestyle.",
